{%- comment -%}
  Integration (store builds only): the store-wide review score and count from the Judge.me shop
  metafields, as "rating|count". Shop metafields can't be dynamic sources in templates, so the
  product rating block reads them through this snippet when Theme settings > Integrations >
  Judge.me reviews is on. Removed from the Theme Store package with every integration-* file.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.integration_reviews_enable -%}
  {{- shop.metafields.judgeme.all_reviews_rating.value -}}|{{- shop.metafields.judgeme.all_reviews_count.value -}}
{%- endif -%}
